i from a gang attack. Shogo, a transfer student, is bailed out of jail and given an ultimatum.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-04-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":15,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xvjKqQskIhnzWcDRQGsY5rCK8dh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xvjKqQskIhnzWcDRQGsY5rCK8dh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62566/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1057816","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Yamoto enjoys an evening out with her friends, Shogo shows up to warn her that the Soukai Syndicate is headhunting her. Sonic Boom makes Yamoto an offer she can't refuse.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-05-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":15,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uRjhkDxVAVwxvCSt3rgH3KQOs9V.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uRjhkDxVAVwxvCSt3rgH3KQOs9V.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62566/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1057817","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After tofu manufacturing plant worker Shigaki loses his arm in an industrial accident, he joins other injured workers in taking revenge against the company. Ninja Slayer continues hunting for members of the Six Gates.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-05-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":15,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uXJAmQSFoxy83RC5rxI4bXkvw7A.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uXJAmQSFoxy83RC5rxI4bXkvw7A.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62566/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1057818","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Under orders from Laomoto, Six Gates ninjas Earthquake and Hugeshuriken hunt for the Dragon Dojo, run by Dragon Gendoso, the last real ninja in Japan, so that they can burn it down.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-05-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":15,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4uoTS0PwtZGUiDoSFwfq7x4wC20.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4uoTS0PwtZGUiDoSFwfq7x4wC20.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62566/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1057819","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Freelance journalist Nancy Lee goes into the forlorn Furutama Projects to chase down a lead, and ends up finding more than she bargained for. Ninja Slayer's Zen meditation is interrupted by an unexpected surprise.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-05-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":15,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6hcCvqlwp4Xm4BQab0oZMUt5f3E.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6hcCvqlwp4Xm4BQab0oZMUt5f3E.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62566/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1057820","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With information that clone cops are about to be introduced into the Neo-Saitama's police force, Nancy and Ninja Slayer break into a secret cloning mill to put a stop to it, but make an unexpected discovery inside.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-06-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":15,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/43N7S9CUrNZyyf4p7kEeISF2Bwc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/43N7S9CUrNZyyf4p7kEeISF2Bwc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62566/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"1057821","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"